diff --git a/docs/ops/account-mail.md b/docs/ops/account-mail.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..aef4797
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/ops/account-mail.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Account e-mails (password reset and e-mail verification)
+
+Sent with Laravel's own `ResetPassword` and `VerifyEmail` notifications,
+rendered in pt-BR with the `pegafila` markdown mail theme.
+
+- **Locale / name:** `APP_NAME=PegaFila`, `APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`,
+  `APP_FALLBACK_LOCALE=en` (`.env.example` and `phpunit.xml`). Mail strings
+  live in `lang/pt_BR.json`.
+- **Theme:** `mail.markdown.theme = pegafila`
+  (`resources/views/vendor/mail/html/themes/pegafila.css`, primary `#0f7490`).
+- **Password reset (guests only):** `password.request` (`GET /forgot-password`),
+  `password.email` (`POST /forgot-password`, `throttle:6,1`, always answers with
+  the `passwords.sent` status so it never reveals whether an address exists),
+  `password.reset` (`GET /reset-password/{token}`), `password.update`
+  (`POST /reset-password`; password min 8, letters, mixed case, numbers,
+  confirmed; rotates `remember_token`, fires `PasswordReset`, redirects to `/`).
+- **E-mail verification:** `verification.verify`
+  (`GET /email/verify/{id}/{hash}`, `auth` + `signed` + `throttle:6,1`); 403
+  unless id and hash match the logged-in user; redirects to `/`. The notice and
+  resend endpoints arrive with the login task.
